#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is much nicer. The order (r) must be less than N, so we will set the "
"maximum denominator to be `15`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ito ay mas maganda. Ang order (r) ay dapat na mas mababa sa N, kaya itakda "
