msgid ""
"As we can see, we obtained the same bitstrings with highest counts. Since "
"quantum hardware has noise, there is some leakage to other bitstrings, which"
" we can filter out statistically.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tulad ng makikita natin, nakuha natin ang parehong mga bitstring na may "
"pinakamataas na bilang. Dahil ang quantum hardware ay may ingay, may ilang "
"leakage sa ibang mga bitstring, na maaari nating i-filter sa pamamagitan ng "
"estadistika.\n"

